Subject: [PATCH 14/14] Rebuild the VPS bundle for 2026-10-04 (13 commits)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the 2026-10-03 bundle: the dated file-copy folder and tarball are
swapped for vps-files-2026-10-04 (54 files), 0011-0013 cover the bundle
regeneration, the 19 repaired broker scripts and run_one.py, and
APPLY-ON-VPS.txt is rewritten for the new layout.

Two things to know when applying it:
  * its git am line reads "0001-*.patch ... 0012-*.patch" and omits 0013,
    so option A misses run_one.py — unpack the tarball or add 0013 by hand.
  * 0008 (590KB) and 0011 (783KB) only add and regenerate patches/ itself;
    they carry no pipeline change and should be skipped on the VPS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
